# Committed narration audited-OK manifest (PRD-11 §6 regression guard source of truth)
!docs/audit/narration-audit.json
# The PWA manifest is a SHIPPED ASSET, not config. The blanket `*.json` above kept it out of git, so it
# existed on the owner's disk and nowhere else: Vercel built without it, `/manifest.json` fell through to
# the SPA rewrite and answered with index.html, and Safari — finding no installable web app — added a
# plain BOOKMARK to the home screen, which opens in the default browser instead of standalone.
!public/manifest.json
# Project Claude config: hooks + the permission allow-list. Shared, no secrets.
# `.claude/settings.local.json` stays ignored - it is personal (defaultMode, extra allows).
!.claude/settings.json

