plans/session-performance/session-log.tsv
plans/session-performance/instructions-loaded.tsv

# iOS signing material — NEVER commit. The blanket `*.json` rule above does not cover these
# extensions, and an App Store Connect API `.p8` is downloadable exactly ONCE, so a leak means
# revoke-and-reissue, not re-download. Real keys live outside the repo entirely
# (C:\Users\<user>\Documents\AppleDeveloper). See tmp-prd-app-store-ios.md §4.4 C6.
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
